5 be expended on the listed project and reflects one hundred
6 percent (100%) of the project cost, including any award by
7 the state loan and investment board under W.S. 35-11-528;
8
9 (iii) "SWDD" means solid waste disposal
10 district;
11
12 (iv) "(T)" means transfer project.
